        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) In a desire to restate their respective policies, neither the Company nor the Union shall discriminate against any Employee because of such Employee's race, color, creed, religion, national origin, citizenship, sex, sexual preference or orientation, marital status, age, physical or mental disability or status as a disabled veteran or a veteran of the Vietnam era.",
